### GET /ExerciseTypes
GET {{healthspan_api_HostAddress}}/ExerciseTypes
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}


### POST /ExerciseTypes
# @name postExerciseType
POST {{healthspan_api_HostAddress}}/ExerciseTypes
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "TestExerciseType",
  "description": "Detailed description of the new exercise type."
}


### PUT /ExerciseTypes
@id_to_update = {{postExerciseType.response.body.id}}
PUT {{healthspan_api_HostAddress}}/ExerciseTypes
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "{{id_to_update}}", 
  "name": "Updated Exercise Type",
  "description": "Updated description of the exercise type."
}

### GET /ExerciseTypes/{id}
GET {{healthspan_api_HostAddress}}/ExerciseTypes/{{id_to_update}}
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
